# Wave W17-U (Route 201): candor sand — first-road pale sand: a bright pale sand running end to end, Clover to Shingle, with the shore’s light still in its flecks (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end). Split from Route 202’s civic spire sand by warmth: this is the country end of the same journey, that is the city end.
